      en: 'Champery is not short of things to do, but a handful of places give a stay its shape: two valley walks, the cable car and the Planachaux sector above the village, two long-standing restaurants and the village’s own summer festival. These are the ones named by the Region Dents du Midi and its own listings, with the figures they publish.',
